    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. but i guess i'm a bit worried bc some people say it's confusing for kids to not just have clear categories like boy or girl. what would you say to someone who thinks it's better for a child's development to stick to those traditional ideas instead of introducing the whole spectrum concept?",
